[bg  time="0"  method="crossfade"  storage="from-PixAI-2053356193076215240.png"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
Wow... What a beautiful morning.[p]
Summer's almost over, isn't it?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
Before this wonderful summer comes to an end, Natsume and I decided to go on an overnight trip together.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_hide_message_window  ]
[tb_image_show  time="1000"  storage="default/mina_project_1.png"  width="768"  height="1280"  x="150"  y="110"  name="img_6"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
Natsume is my girlfriend. We've been together for almost a year now.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
She's always so cheerful and full of energy. No matter where we go or what we're doing, she somehow has this special way of brightening up everything around her.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
I've always been grateful to have her by my side...[p]
But when I think about it, I've never really done anything special for her.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
So on this trip, I want to give her as many happy memories as I can.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
......[p]

Maybe I'll look through the album and revisit some old memories while I wait for Natsume...[p]

It's not like she'll be back anytime soon anyway.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[glink  color="white"  storage="phone_album.ks"  size="40"  text="Open&nbsp;the&nbsp;photo&nbsp;album&nbsp;on&nbsp;my&nbsp;phone."  x="80"  y="1000"  ]
[glink  color="white"  storage="scene1.ks"  size="40"  text="Natsume&nbsp;should&nbsp;be&nbsp;back&nbsp;soon.&nbsp;I'll&nbsp;just&nbsp;wait."  x="80"  y="1200"  target="*natsume_appear"  ]
[tb_hide_message_window  ]
